{"batch": 5, "candidates": [{"answer": "采用后向散射法OTDR", "evidence": [{"excerpt": "1 中继段光纤的损耗测量： 1)仪表的测试状态应与前次的测试状态相同。 2)当发现光纤通道损耗增大或后向散射信号曲线上有大台阶时，应适当增加检查次数，组织技术人员进行分析， 查找原因，及时采取改善措施。 3)发现光缆中有若干根光纤的衰减变动量都大于0.1dB/km 时，应迅速进行处理。", "passage_id": "e3cf39da121b2a8bcc3179f0"}], "question": "中继段光纤的损耗测量采用什么方法？", "question_type": "exact_fact"}, {"answer": "12 芯光缆以下 90％，12 芯 以上95%", "evidence": [{"excerpt": "备用纤芯光纤衰减与平均损耗测试 抽测50%，主用纤芯按需，质量指标符合规 范，纤芯完好率 12 芯光缆以下 90％，12 芯 以上95%。", "passage_id": "e3cf39da121b2a8bcc3179f0"}], "question": "备用纤芯光纤衰减与平均损耗测试的纤芯完好率要求是多少？", "question_type": "exact_fact"}, {"answer": "记录", "evidence": [{"excerpt": "100＜ρ≤500 记录 ρ＞500 记录", "passage_id": "e3cf39da121b2a8bcc3179f0"}], "question": "防护接地装置地线电阻ρ＞500时的测试记录周期是多久？", "question_type": "exact_fact"}], "decisions": [{"reason": "excerpt_not_verbatim", "status": "rejected"}, {"reason": "excerpt_not_verbatim", "status": "rejected"}, {"case": {"case_id": "p6s-0470", "expected_behavior": "answer", "generation_batch": 5, "generation_corpus_sha256": "5995ee6be2871ee7c553ce5fe2f3002a7938dbffedf0ec2b8fed28af8107f4d6", "generation_model": "ollama/qwen3:4b-instruct-2507-q4_K_M", "generation_model_digest": "0edcdef34593eac1aa2be9c7d06c432dcf81945adca5eca2f27662c18f168ba0", "generation_seed": 20271111, "generation_version": "0edcdef34593eac1aa2be9c7d06c432dcf81945adca5eca2f27662c18f168ba0", "label_type": "silver", "prompt_version": "p6-silver-generate-v1", "question": "防护接地装置地线电阻ρ＞500时的测试记录周期是多久？", "question_type": "exact_fact", "reference_answer": "记录", "source_chunk_ids": ["e3cf39da121b2a8bcc3179f0"], "source_document": ["电信基础设施维护规程.pdf"], "source_evidence": [{"chunk_id": "e3cf39da121b2a8bcc3179f0", "excerpt": "100＜ρ≤500 记录 ρ＞500 记录"}], "source_page": 32, "topup_version": "p6-silver-topup-v1"}, "reason": null, "status": "accepted"}], "event": "result"}
